!
! How many entries of an audit record are of one kind, in Trebago
! (witness_rules.h WR2): each entry counts 1 when its kind is want (both
! 1 + kind - want and 1 + want - kind are at least 1), else 0. Exact.
trebago kind_count
  in  kind(n), want
  out count
  count = sum(i, max(0, min(1, 1 + kind(i) - want)) * max(0, min(1, 1 + want - kind(i))))
end
